    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
    # ORCID PLACEHOLDER — no ORCID on record. Register one at https://orcid.org
    # and uncomment, keeping the full URI form. Do not invent an identifier.
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: >-
  Audits a retrieval-augmented-generation faithfulness judge for the
  citation-attribution blind spot. The Fidecite citation_relocation operator
  re-points every [N] citation marker to a passage that does not support its
  claim, while the claim stays supported by some other passage, and reports how
  often the judge is still fooled. Ships the attribution-aware prompt fix.
repository-code: "https://github.com/rsrijith/joint-failure-rag-eval"
url: "https://github.com/rsrijith/joint-failure-rag-eval"
license: MIT
